## 1. Jler Laser — E-commerce Website Development

**Website:** https://jlerlaser.com/

**Project Overview**

Developed and customized a WooCommerce website for an industrial laser equipment business, focusing on product presentation, dynamic data integration, and customized e-commerce functionality.

**Key Contributions**
- Customized website layouts and product pages using Elementor, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and PHP.
- Developed custom WooCommerce plugins to extend product information display functionality.
- Connected backend product data with frontend components, enabling dynamic rendering of product details, images, attributes, and other product information.
- Customized reusable product modules to improve content management and maintainability.
- Assisted with website testing, debugging, and deployment.

**Technologies:** WordPress, WooCommerce, Elementor, PHP, HTML, CSS, JavaScript.

